		{
			description: [
				"&bYuushya Townscape&r mod contains &o2600+&r delicate building materials and decorations with well-designed textures. "
				""
				"Elaborate but simple features like signs, connected models and block model relocating."
				""
				"There is a bit of search kung-fu involved to get started.  It's best to search &a@yuushya&r in the &eInventory search bar&r and find decor you like.  Once you determine the '&dprototype&r', you can proceed to craft them with the below"
				""
				"To craft decor: "
				""
				" &61&r. &bCraft &aBismuth Crystals&r (The more the merrier)"
				" &62&r. Using a &eStonecutter&r, shape the &aBismuth Crystal&r into '&dprototype&r' blocks"
				" &63&r. Right-click use the &dprototype&r blocks and craft the desired decor blocks"
			]
